{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13913","headline":"早春思归有唱竹枝歌者坐中下泪 · 顾况","name":"早春思归有唱竹枝歌者坐中下泪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渺渺春生楚水波，楚人齐唱竹枝歌。\n与君皆是思归客，拭泪看花奈老何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}